======================================================================
MANUSCRIPT RULE
======================================================================

No sensitivity percentage, stress value, strain value, displacement
value, or deviation should be reported as an executed measured result
until the corresponding raw computational output is recovered and
reconciled.

This file therefore preserves the sensitivity-analysis design without
converting expected or illustrative values into claimed simulation
results.

